  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1802.18 Asbestos management planner",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1802.18 “Asbestos management planner” means an individual who has met the criteria in Env-A 1816.05 and been issued a certification pursuant to Env-A 1815 to assess the health hazard posed by ACM, determine the appropriate response action, and develop a schedule for implementing a response action.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1800.html"
